# Never send local configuration or credentials to the Docker daemon. Keep
# this broad: Vite recognizes several .env.* variants and can bake their
# contents into frontend assets during a build.
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/secrets/

